## Bulk Operations

### Bulk Actions
```http
POST /recordings/bulk/{action}
```

**Actions:** `deploy-to-asterisk`, `generate-audio`, `delete`

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "recordingIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "options": {
    "force": true
  }
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "action": "generate-audio",
  "totalRecordings": 3,
  "successful": 2,
  "failed": 1,
  "results": [
    {
      "recordingId": 1,
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "fileName": "tenant_1_1_timestamp.mp3",
        "fileSize": 45632
      }
    }
  ],
  "errors": [
    {
      "recordingId": 3,
      "error": "No text provided for audio generation"
    }
  ]
}
```

