## Audio Generation & File Management

### Generate Audio
```http
POST /recordings/{id}/generate
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "fileName": "tenant_1_1_timestamp.mp3",
  "fileUrl": "/recordings/tenant_1_1_timestamp.mp3",
  "fileSize": 45632,
  "generatedAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
  "message": "Audio generated successfully"
}
```

### Upload Audio File
```http
POST /recordings/{id}/upload
```

**Request:** Multipart form data with `audio` file field

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "File uploaded successfully",
  "recording": {
    "id": 1,
    "fileName": "uploaded_file.mp3",
    "fileSize": 45632,
    "generatedAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
  }
}
```

### Serve Audio File
```http
GET /recordings/{id}/audio
```

**Response:** Audio file stream with appropriate headers

### Stream Audio (Real-time from Eleven Labs)
```http
GET /recordings/{id}/stream
```

**Response:** Audio stream directly from Eleven Labs API

